350
00:15:28,310 --> 00:15:29,790
本来就是该尿在里面啊
You're supposed to do that.

351
00:15:29,790 --> 00:15:32,130
不是在试穿的时候
Not during the fitting.

352
00:15:33,380 --> 00:15:36,480
孩子  需要我提醒你上次你升空前
Son, do I need to remind you what you asked me to do

353
00:15:36,480 --> 00:15:38,150
你求我做什么吗
before you went up last time?

354
00:15:38,150 --> 00:15:41,050
慢着  我那只是开玩笑
Hang on. That was just me joking around.

355
00:15:41,050 --> 00:15:44,220
你要我冲你的脚开枪
You wanted me to shoot you in the foot.

356
00:15:44,990 --> 00:15:46,340
这怎么可能不是玩笑啦
Come on, how is that not a joke?

357
00:15:46,340 --> 00:15:48,280
"你得帮我脱身  冲我的脚开枪"
"You got to get me out of this. Shoot me in the foot."

358
00:15:50,710 --> 00:15:53,850
别忘了其他宇航员欺负你的事
Don't forget all the other astronauts picking on you.

359
00:15:53,850 --> 00:15:55,610
还有你在失重环境下吐了
And how you threw up in zero gravity,

360
00:15:55,610 --> 00:15:57,900
呕吐物又飘回到你嘴里
and it floated back in your mouth.

361
00:15:58,550 --> 00:15:59,770
然后你又吐了
And you threw up again.

362
00:15:59,770 --> 00:16:02,170
这过程周而复始
And so on and so on.

363
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:05,810
那蛮搞笑的
That was funny.

364
00:16:06,920 --> 00:16:10,480
我在上面的表现是比不上约翰·格伦[著名宇航员]
Okay, so I wasn't exactly John Glenn up there,

365
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:13,530
但我改变了  我现在不同了
but I've changed; I'm a different man now.

366
00:16:13,530 --> 00:16:15,270
你们觉得我不能胜任
Yeah, and I'm a little insulted

367
00:16:15,270 --> 00:16:17,550
让我有种被羞辱的感觉
that you guys don't think I can handle it.

368
00:16:17,550 --> 00:16:20,580
你知道你还得再次通过生存训练吧
You know you're gonna have to go through survival training again.

369
00:16:20,580 --> 00:16:21,530
是吗
Really?

370
00:16:21,530 --> 00:16:24,000
你得帮我脱身
You've got to get me out of this!

371
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:26,460
你想要我怎么做  你太健康了
What do you want me to do? You're perfectly healthy.

372
00:16:26,460 --> 00:16:28,390
再量下我的血压
Check my blood pressure again!

373
00:16:28,390 --> 00:16:30,810
我可以让血压升高  稍等
I can get it higher; just give me a second.

374
00:16:33,070 --> 00:16:35,890
-喂  -妈  你好吗
- Hello? - Hi, Ma. How are you?

375
00:16:36,340 --> 00:16:38,240
老娘还没死呢
How I am is not dead!

376
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:39,520
但你不会知道
But you wouldn't know that,

377
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:42,300
因为你根本不爱我  电话都懒得打
because you don't love me enough to pick up the phone!

378
00:16:42,300 --> 00:16:44,040
快量快量
Go, go, go!

379
00:16:44,540 --> 00:16:47,700
你得知道  我有可能在浴缸滑倒摔死
For all you know, I could have slipped in the tub and drowned!

380
00:16:48,100 --> 00:16:50,970
你艾达阿姨就是这么死的
That's what happened to your Aunt Ida!

381
00:16:58,100 --> 00:17:00,720
霍华德  真遗憾你的血压这么高
Howard, I'm so sorry your blood pressure was off the charts.

382
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:03,230
我也是  医生倒是愿意
Oh, me, too. I mean, the doctor was willing

383
00:17:03,230 --> 00:17:05,030
为我捏造健康报告  但是
to fudge the results, but...

384
00:17:05,030 --> 00:17:08,670
那太他娘不诚实了
it just seemed so darned dishonest.

385
00:17:10,370 --> 00:17:12,420
但离任务开始不是至少还有一年吗
But the mission wouldn't be for at least a year.

386
00:17:12,420 --> 00:17:14,030
你的血压不是还有足够时间恢复到...
Isn't that enough time to get your blood pressure under...

387
00:17:14,030 --> 00:17:17,260
我知道我血压太高  别再提这事了
Look, my blood pressure's too high, okay? Drop it.

388
00:17:18,730 --> 00:17:20,420
我姨妈改变了饮食习惯
You know, my aunt changed her diet,

389
00:17:20,420 --> 00:17:22,300
-几个月后  她...  -上了太空吗
- and in a few months, she... - Went to space?

390
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:24,390
我想不可能吧  把酱油递给我
I don't think so. Now, pass the soy sauce.

391
00:17:24,390 --> 00:17:26,350
不要绿色那瓶  要红色的
Hey, not the green one; the red one.

392
00:17:27,710 --> 00:17:30,230
谢尔顿  艾米  过来和我们一起吃好吗
Sheldon, Amy, will you please come join us?

393
00:17:30,270 --> 00:17:31,620
是啊  这里很欢乐
Yeah, it's fun up here.

394
00:17:31,620 --> 00:17:33,960
那你为什么要毁了欢乐时光呢
So why are you trying to ruin it?

395
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:37,280
好意心领了  我们很好
No, thanks. We're fine.

396
00:17:37,280 --> 00:17:39,650
如果你们想在餐桌上吃饭
I mean, if you people want to eat at the table,

397
00:17:39,650 --> 00:17:41,650
你们就在那里吃吧
then that's what you should do.

398
00:17:41,650 --> 00:17:43,130
我喜欢在这里吃饭
I like eating down here

399
00:17:43,130 --> 00:17:46,070
因为我们以前一直是这样
because this is how we've always done things.

400
00:17:46,070 --> 00:17:48,470
如果过去的岁月逝去了  那就随风去吧
But if those days are gone, they're gone.

401
00:17:48,470 --> 00:17:51,420
只是  让我很伤心
It just... makes me sad.

402
00:17:52,690 --> 00:17:53,860
现在我也伤心了
Now I feel bad.

403
00:17:53,860 --> 00:17:56,640
别把他当人看  他有双无辜大眼
Oh, don't anthropomorphize him; he's got big eyes,

404
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:59,670
但他的情感和我们人类不同
but his feelings are not like ours.

405
00:18:01,530 --> 00:18:04,350
不  我们分成两组坐看起来好傻
No, it just seems silly for us to sit in two groups.

406
00:18:04,350 --> 00:18:06,060
如果你把那组的领导人
Well, it's not silly if you think of that group

407
00:18:06,060 --> 00:18:09,850
想成是巨型魔婴  就不会觉得傻了
as being led by a big, evil baby.

408
00:18:14,170 --> 00:18:16,390
看艾米坐在那里的样子
Look at Amy down there.

409
00:18:16,390 --> 00:18:18,290
我们应该过去吗
Should we go?

410
00:18:18,290 --> 00:18:19,580
好吧  我们过去
Yeah, let's go.

411
00:18:19,580 --> 00:18:21,650
但是  佩妮  这原本是你的主意
But... Penny, this was your idea.

412
00:18:21,650 --> 00:18:23,550
你说我应该奋起和他抗争
You said that I should stand up to him.

413
00:18:23,550 --> 00:18:24,640
算了吧  莱纳德
Forget it, Leonard.

414
00:18:25,040 --> 00:18:26,610
抗战结束
It's over.

415
00:18:27,620 --> 00:18:29,260
好吧
Fine.

416
00:18:35,380 --> 00:18:36,700
拉杰什
Rajesh?

417
00:18:36,700 --> 00:18:38,740
去死吧  我在地板上坐了七年
Screw that! I sat on the floor for seven years.

418
00:18:38,740 --> 00:18:41,140
人家要坐在这里
I'm staying right here!

419
00:18:41,140 --> 00:18:44,810
来吧  拉杰  有你感觉才完整
Come on, Raj, it's not the same without you.

420
00:18:45,210 --> 00:18:46,940
好吧
Fine.

421
00:18:48,170 --> 00:18:51,060
但不许再嘲笑我说的"花"[话]
But no more making fun of how I say tings.

422
00:18:51,060 --> 00:18:54,070
你说的"花"是指"笑虎子"吗
You mean "tings" like "moo-stache"?

423
00:18:59,900 --> 00:19:02,390
大家齐聚一堂感觉真好
Well, isn't this nice.

424
00:19:04,210 --> 00:19:07,100
偶尔魔婴也有赢的时候嘛
Sometimes the baby wins.

